# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal data -- never publish
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# run logs (real account names), shared-links.txt (your copied links), max-watch dumps
# (screenshots of videos)
runs/
# your phone's IP:port and time zone; the template stays in the repository
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tuning data -- kept private (DEVELOPMENT.md 5)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Screenshots of a real feed (third-party videos, the owner's feed): traces = 13,449 small
# grayscale full-screen frames of 35 videos (~210 MB), icon_samples = button crops with video
# behind them. Only the tuning / icon-mask tools need them; the app needs just
# assets/icon_masks.npz. Record your own with tools/record_traces.py.
tools/traces/
tools/traces_1x/
tools/icon_samples/

